row(10, 17, 'MATERIAL', f'FOR THE LORD YOUR GOD, HE IS GOD OF GODS AND LORD OF LORDS, THE GREAT, THE MIGHTY AND THE AWESOME GOD, WHO LIFTS NO FACE AND TAKES NO BRIBE. {HP(10, 17, (("כי", "יהוה", "אלהיכם", "הוא"), "for the LORD your God (PL.), He — \'your God\' plural at 17 alone in the chapter"), (("אלהי", "האלהים", "ואדני", "האדנים"), "is God of gods and Lord of lords — the clause 10:17 and PSALM 136:2-3 (the psalm\'s two verses on it)"), (("האל", "הגדל", "הגבר", "והנורא"), "the great, the mighty and the awesome God — Nehemiah 9:32 whole; Jeremiah 32:18 and Nehemiah 1:5, Daniel 9:4 with one dropped (Yoma 69b at the docket); \'the God\' with the article Genesis 31:13, 46:3, 7:9, 10:17 in the Torah"), (("אשר", "לא", "ישא", "פנים"), "who lifts no face — 10:17 and 28:50; Leviticus 19:15 \'you shall not lift the face of the poor\' and NUMBERS 6:26 \'the LORD lift His face to you\' the kin (the blessing ledger\'s three reconciliations)"), (("ולא", "יקח", "שחד"), "and takes no bribe — 16:19 \'you shall not take\', Exodus 23:8 \'a bribe you shall not take\', 27:25 \'who takes a bribe\'; the bribe\'s six Torah tokens"))} {AP(10, 17, (("אלהא", "דינין", "ומרי", "מלכין"), "GOD OF JUDGES AND LORD OF KINGS — the gods made judges (16:18 the word\'s other seat), the lords kings (33:20, 24)"), (("אלהא", "רבא", "גברא", "ודחילא"), "the great, mighty and awesome God"), (("די", "לית", "קדמוהי", "מסב", "אפין"), "before whom there is no taking of faces"), (("ואף", "לא", "לקבלא", "שחדא"), "nor the accepting of a bribe"))} The three attributes the prayer\'s (Nehemiah 9:32; the Talmud\'s eighteen blessings from this verse — Yoma 69b, Berakhot 33b at the docket); the two negations the judge\'s law turned into the Judge\'s nature (16:19 the seat by CALL at the compile).')
